  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brookings Institution 2023- 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Activities of the Brookings Institution aim to comprehensively contribute to informing a broad spectrum of stakeholders, providing independent, reliable research and analysis, as well as ideas and recommendations, in order to develop solutions that support the rules-based international order for global peace and security. Project Activities will deliver policy relevant research on the Middle East and North Africa, South Asia and Sub-Sahara Africa, as well as on energy, environment, and climate policy, that will be made available to stakeholders, policy experts and the public.</narrative>
  </description>
